CM_ SG_ 920 S398_b10 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0x8C), meaning unknown | superwofy/E9X-M-CAN-Integration-Module notes (MIT): Traction mode request: bytes CF E3 = DSC fully on, CF F3 = DTC/MDM, CF E7 = DSC fully off";
CM_ BO_ 921 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3): DSC RX | E65 message list: 'Status M-Drive' from DME1 | Not observed in the 320i PT-CAN log";
CM_ SG_ 921 CHKSM_399 "BMW 4-bit checksum: s = fold8(sum(bytes, checksum nibble = 0) + 0x9C); chk = ((s >> 4) + (s & 0xF)) & 0xF - verified 99/99 in the E92 M3 K-CAN trace (superwofy); algorithm as in the superwofy firmware";
CM_ SG_ 921 ALIV_399 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0xCD), meaning unknown | 4-bit alive counter, counts 0..14, +1 per frame (E92 M3 K-CAN trace)";
CM_ SG_ 921 S399_b8 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0x7C), meaning unknown | superwofy/E9X-M-CAN-Integration-Module notes (MIT): firmware update_mdrive_settings_can_message(): +1 on byte 1 when M-Drive is active";
CM_ SG_ 921 S399_b10 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0xA5), meaning unknown | superwofy/E9X-M-CAN-Integration-Module notes (MIT): DSC mode stored in the M-Drive setting (firmware: byte 1 = 0x05 off, 0x09 on, 0x11 MDM, +1 when active). The M3 DSC firmware reads this field; with M3/1M DSC software MDM is selected through 0x399 only. E92 M3 trace: byte 1 = 0x51 (MDM, M-Drive inactive)";
CM_ BO_ 940 "E65 message list: 'Nachlaufzeit Klemme 30 fehlergesteuert' from KGM | 320i log: 3 frames, DLC 2";
CM_ BO_ 944 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3): DSC RX | MEVD17.2 BN2000: 'Status Gang Rückwärts', sender LM, DME receives, cycle 1000 ms, DLC 2, variants [x x x x x] | DSC DTC D378: D378 - PT_CAN_Timeout message 944 (Status_Gang_Rueckwaerts) is missing [DE: D378 - PT_CAN_Timeout Botschaft 944  (Status_Gang_Rueckwaerts) fehlt] (supervised: timeout) | TIS: start-off assistant also works uphill in reverse gear | E65 message list: 'Status Gang Rückwärts' from LM | Not observed in the 320i PT-CAN log | cycle time source: BN2000";
CM_ SG_ 944 S3B0_b0 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0xA6), meaning unknown | superwofy/E9X-M-CAN-Integration-Module notes (MIT): firmware evaluate_reverse_gear_status(): byte 0 = 0xFE with reverse engaged; 0xFD otherwise (inferred from the 2-bit pattern)";
CM_ BO_ 945 "E65 message list: 'Getriebedaten 3' from EGS_MECH/DKG | Not observed in the 320i PT-CAN log | Bus not confirmed: only in community DBC (kept because it has decoded signals)";
